{"id":"shag","lemma":"шаг","pos":"noun","rank":652,"glosses":["step","move, step, action, initiative","pace, gait, stride (manner/way of walking)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fd/Ru-%D1%88%D0%B0%D0%B3.ogg/Ru-%D1%88%D0%B0%D0%B3.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"шага","plural":"шаги"},"examples":[{"text":"Это большой шаг.","en":"It's a big step.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"big, large, great"},null]},{"text":"Я слышал шаги.","en":"I heard footsteps.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear","l":"слышать"},null]},{"text":"Давайте сделаем это как первый шаг.","en":"Let's do this as a first step.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"first"},null]},{"text":"Том сделал три шага назад.","en":"Tom took three steps backward.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"three"},null,{"g":"back"}]},{"text":"Ещё шаг - и ты труп.","en":"One more step and you're dead.","words":[{"g":"still / more"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"corpse, dead body"}]}]}